<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef firm to higher on good demand and mostly moderate offerings.  Select cuts firm, while Choice cuts mostly higher. Beef trimmings weak on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
